    "text": "By Maria Toledo Flores ,\n2 hours ago One of pop culture's favorite blondes is making a comeback, but this time she's not at \"perfectly respectable\" Harvard. The official trailer for the highly anticipated prequel series \"Elle\" follows \"Legally Blonde\" main character Elle Woods in high school, where she navigates tricky friendships, forbidden romance, and some truly questionable fashion choices. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
